  "description": "CR 731.2i / 707.8a / 712.13: a token copy of a merged permanent is single-faced, so Cackling Counterpart's copy of a Hollowhenge Huntmaster with Cubwarden mutated under it stays the Huntmaster when it becomes day, and Cyber Conversion turns it face down",
